WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Before you buy a water filter pitcher,
check more than the pitcher.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.200
The cartridge inside matters most.

00:06.200 --> 00:10.700
Different cartridges reduce different contaminants,
and replacement costs can add up.

00:10.700 --> 00:15.700
Check what the specific filter is certified to reduce,
and how often you’ll need to replace it.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.200
Want help choosing?

00:17.200 --> 00:21.060
Take my free, three-question quiz
at WaterCheckup.com.
